flowchart TD
    A[User request] --> B[LLM reasons over tool schemas]
    B --> C{Tool needed?}
    C -- No --> D[Answer directly]
    C -- Yes --> E[Emit structured tool call: name + JSON args]
    E --> F[Validate args against schema]
    F --> G{Valid?}
    G -- No --> H[Return error to model, retry]
    H --> B
    G -- Yes --> I[Execute tool / API]
    I --> J[Return result to model]
    J --> K{More tools?}
    K -- Yes --> B
    K -- No --> L[Final response grounded in results]
